>> title: Alfredo Sauce
>> category: Sauces & Gravies
>> tags: cheese, cream, pasta, vegetarian, stovetop
>> servings: 4
>> time: 20 min
>> step.1: melt 2 min
>> step.2: simmer 5 min
>> step.3: whisk in off heat
>> step.4: season

Melt @unsalted butter{1/2%cup}(115 g) with @garlic{2%cloves}(minced) over medium-low heat for ~{2%min}.

Simmer @heavy cream{1 1/2%cups}(360 mL) in @&(~1)garlic butter{} for ~{5%min}, until it lightly coats a spoon.

Whisk @grated Parmigiano-Reggiano{1 1/2%cups}(150 g) into @&(~1)cream{} off the heat, a handful at a time.

Season @&(~1)sauce{} with @kosher salt{1/2%tsp}, @black pepper{1/2%tsp}, and @grated nutmeg{1/8%tsp}.
